WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:04.580
Speaker 1: Welcome back to the David Pakman
show, I am Farron Cousins from Ring of Fire,

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.830
sitting in for David Pakman all of this week.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.000
Let's talk about January six, shall we?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.100
Obviously, in the last few weeks here, we've
gotten some very important news.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:21.490
I would call it about the events of that day,
the events before that day, the PowerPoints,

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:26.390
the text messages, the emails, the phone calls,
all kinds of stuff.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.499
But some of the most important information
we've gotten about January six has actually

00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:32.570
come from the courts.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:38.520
Late last week, the harshest sentence to date
for one of the Capitol rioters was handed

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.350
down the man who assaulted a police officer
with a fire extinguisher.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.770
Sentenced to a little more than five years
in prison.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.000
And of course, this individual expressed his.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.740
Sorrow, his sadness at what he did, you know,
got the crocodile tears going.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.740
But.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.880
Judge didn't buy it.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.609
Still sentence him to more than five years.

00:01:06.609 --> 00:01:10.070
And this is becoming routine at this point.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.880
This is what we're seeing happening.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.200
With these judges in the sentences that they're
handing down.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.249
And here's why.

00:01:18.249 --> 00:01:23.110
And this is very important, and this is something
that everybody needs to understand about the

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:26.810
cases these judges are hearing.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:31.359
Because judges are telling us this past week.

00:01:31.359 --> 00:01:33.619
That January six is it's not over.

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:36.990
It's not over.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:42.689
And the reason for that is because what radicalized
these individuals has not stopped, it has

00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:44.450
not gone away.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:48.380
While these particular people, the ones who
have been sentenced, the ones who are going

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:53.479
to jail are currently in jail, they're probably
not as likely to engage in that kind of behavior

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:54.820
in the future.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:02:02.159
We're still creating another army, essentially
of these crazed people who think the election

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:04.380
was stolen.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:07.290
That's what January six was.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:12.720
Here's another thing I filled in for David
back in August, one of the stories I talked

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:15.640
about at the time, I remember vividly.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:19.250
Was the fact that judges back in August.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.430
We're telling us.

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:28.010
That we're probably facing another January
six type situation.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:34.319
Because of the radicalization process, because
the Big Lie still persisted out there.

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:40.750
And in fact, because it was being pushed even
harder in August than it was in January.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:45.840
And now here we are, four and a half months
after those judges told us that more judges

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:50.230
came out in the past week and effectively
told us the same thing.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:56.150
That we can expect more, we can expect worse,
and we can expect this because the radicalization

00:02:56.150 --> 00:03:01.480
still exists because nothing has been done
to stop it, because honestly, it's hard to

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.500
stop it right?

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.180
These people have free speech.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.099
We can't tell them they're not allowed to
say these things.

00:03:08.099 --> 00:03:11.250
That's illegal.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.090
But they're also not being held accountable
by the media outlets who allow them to say

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.090
these things.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.220
On their social media platforms, where they
spew these lies every day in the speeches

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:26.250
that they give, and again, part of this is
because there's literally nothing we can do

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.250
about it.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.610
All we can do is go out there every day and
talk about how this is a lie.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:32.670
This is not true.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:37.810
All of the evidence, including the audits
and investigations conducted by conservative

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.379
groups, are all telling us there's no fraud.

00:03:39.379 --> 00:03:40.560
There was no theft.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:45.609
But even still, 70 percent of the Republican
Party believes Joe Biden is not the duly elected

00:03:45.609 --> 00:03:49.909
president of the United States that the 2020
election was stolen.

00:03:49.909 --> 00:03:56.170
70 percent of Republicans believe that now.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:02.680
And if we had listened to these judges months
ago, that wouldn't come as a shock.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:09.120
What happened on January 6th was kind of an
immediate radicalization of individuals who

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.689
were most of them, probably kind of already
on the edge.

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:14.060
They were hard core supporters.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:18.769
They had their feelings hurt that their guy
didn't win or.

00:04:18.769 --> 00:04:23.139
And then he told them, go fight like hell
or you won't have a country anymore.

00:04:23.139 --> 00:04:28.479
How one of the accused rioters last week in
front of a judge said Trump gave me permission

00:04:28.479 --> 00:04:29.479
to do this.

00:04:29.479 --> 00:04:35.110
I had a right to storm the Capitol because
the former president gave me permission.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:39.720
So they took that that one statement from
him, and while the rest of it as well, that

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:44.300
was their action and they went with it.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.840
That's how quickly that radicalization happened
for many of those individuals, for the rest

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:54.500
of them, we're talking about radicalization
that's been going on for a year now.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.460
Radicalization that is taking hold within
the Republican Party to the point seventy

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:03.240
percent look at Joe Biden and say that man
who I also think is incompetent somehow stole

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.240
the election.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:10.210
For the record, two things can't be true there,
he can't be such an incompetent idiot, you

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.580
can't even stay awake and a mastermind who
stole the 2020 election.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.110
That makes no sense.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:21.990
Yet this is what they believe, and the judges
are still out there warning us that, yeah,

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:25.080
things are going to get bad again, things
are probably going to be worse than what they

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:27.570
already were.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:32.050
Because nothing is being done, and in many
instances, there's nothing legal we can do

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.990
about it.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:38.729
All we can do is fight back against the misinformation.

00:05:38.729 --> 00:05:42.660
And as somebody who does do this every day,
and I'm sure David feels the same way, sometimes

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:45.300
it feels like this Sisyphean task.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:50.210
We're pushing this boulder up the hill, only
to watch it roll back down again and start

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.039
all over.

00:05:52.039 --> 00:05:56.060
There's no end, there's no there's no clear
victory here.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:06:01.830
We're just destined to do this forever to
fight back against this conservative misinformation.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.830
But like Sisyphus himself, we're never going
to stop.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:08.870
As part of our job, it's what we do.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:10.819
It's how we help.

00:06:10.819 --> 00:06:13.190
So that's what we're doing here.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:17.270
That's what these judges are trying to do,
they're giving us the warnings, and if we

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:21.830
don't heed these warnings, then yeah, we're
probably going to be looking at something

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:27.839
much worse than what happened on January 6th
at some point in the future.

